  "body": "https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/6311 was found as a result of an `UDPATE` call expecting a row to already exist in Synapse's database. While this row was created in a delta file, when we squished everything into a full_schema, the INSERT got lost.\r\n\r\nAll `UPDATE` statements that expect a row to already exist in a table in the DB should be checked, starting with `appservice_stream`. Starting by looking at the DB tables rather than the codebase may be easiest.",
